ッピング対象を設定するもの\n• Escだと、特殊要件になる(動的にescのimapを作って対応)\n• 無効だと自前でケアする必要がある\n• キーマッピング(自分は `let g:lexima_map_escape = '\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lexima-esc)'` しておくと、それに`lexima#insmode#escape()`  のための処理を作ってくれる\nで、自分はマッピングを作って、それと他の機能を連結して上手く動かすということをしていた","ts":"1632556826.065500","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1632556848.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7T76t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f181c680-6e9c-4071-940d-a36908c1a221","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`autocmd InsertLeavePre * call lexima#insmode#escape()`","ts":"1632554296.062500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B4wD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a526fdbc-946e-444a-85ab-3165157947dc","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ひとまずやってみよう","ts":"1632554273.062300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yEw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"227b381c-9726-41e5-95bf-bb58110c97c6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"うーん、自分もInsertLeavePreに仕込んだ方がいいんだろうか","ts":"1632554229.062100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MuDZ7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7918da7a-1a83-4ab9-a720-e2cb5f2d45a1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いろいろ確認して直す","ts":"1632553945.061800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ggseQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"859B3C45-92F9-458B-9E1C-02B73834BD5A","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"何もしてないけど気になっていなかった、どこが挙動変わるんだろ・・・","ts":"1632548858.061400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DEB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4733d30f-d47b-4df8-b913-b830faa81ef9","type":"message","user":"UD73ZNZAP","text":"`lexima#insmode#escape()`から呼ばれる`lexima#insmode#leave()`で\nいろいろ後処理してるっぽくて必要そう\nやるな