ce_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AGw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aecb7c70-a2be-4839-8558-c553425a1f26","type":"message","user":"UD73ZNZAP","text":"leximaは一度移行した後にESCがmapされていてlinuxでの日本語入力環境的に合わなかったので\nsmartinputに戻ってしまった（ESCがmapされているとiminsert=0相当になってしまう）","ts":"1632534873.040500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"36Mh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9347291-45d9-41f3-b7c5-5a755732003f","type":"message","user":"UD73ZNZAP","text":"かなり昔なんですけどsmartchrと同じkanaさんのsmartinputが遅くなったときがあって\n多分ですが正規表現エンジンにNFAが追加された頃だと思う…\nその時から個人的にsmartinputのsearchにstoplineを追加するパッチを入れてます","ts":"1632534369.040300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+RfX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"580e2fc6-41d1-412d-99e8-05d86d096e03","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ddc移行作業続きやるぞ〜!","ts":"1632533652.039800","thread_ts":"1632533652.039800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"msR2Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01ad1a85-579d-400a-93ab-c93a7ebc1754","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"Windows環境はleximaになってるけれど、Macはなぜかsmartchrだったので、試してみましょ。","ts":"1632529173.039300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V+T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0edc3f8f-093d-4cd9-8ce3-3a2295727e21","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"lexima試しましょう（パフォーマンス分からんけど）","ts":"1632529083.038800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"85I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36823d07-fb19-45d4-933d-44632abb99c5","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"やはり古いテキストは別ファイルに退避するワークアラウンドから逃げられないかー","ts":"1632528908.037900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wpcG"}]},{"client_msg_i