link":"https://twitter.com/CChatyusha/status/1441373110599503874","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1381197768404791296/FRr6pWfp_normal.jpg","text":"入れるだけで動くPlugin派と自由度の高いPlugin派があるらしい。\n自由度の高いPluginの標準的な設定を自動でやってくれるような溝を埋めるものがあれば世界は平和になるだろう。\nというわけで開発スタート!!\n\u0026lt;目標10月以内\u0026gt;\n\u003chttps://github.com/Chatyusha/easy-ddc.vim\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1632485103,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/CChatyusha/status/1441373110599503874","original_url":"https://twitter.com/CChatyusha/status/1441373110599503874"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nj5cH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6ed6376-a019-4ee0-b762-36d21197a01d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"基本的にpatchはマージしません","ts":"1632521532.033700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HsyW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53688cdc-8422-49ea-978b-ad8ab4a6889b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"はい 優先してほしい順に、上から tap を書いてたので、大丈夫です","ts":"1632502849.033000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gY=hn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe0c1f5f-a3b1-44ae-abe5-de62e262a29f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ddc.vim の sources の配列は、そのまま優先度順になるので、先に出てほしい source を先に書いておく必要があったりする","ts":"1632502791.032500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SIr0K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"caa56bbf-8c86-4ad6-8de1-2f3641f871b1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"いい感じに tap の中で、配列に追加して、最後に配列を `patch_global` して動くようになりました","ts":"1632502492.031700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wFk/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8bcca420-8883-4eaa-afee-ce716af7eaa9","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"なるほどありがとうございます。","ts":"1632502447.030700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zSA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"542edab4-f503-4dc4-88cf-d4773df892ce","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"patch_xxx がどこまでいい感じにマージしてくれるのかはドキュメント見ただけだとちょっとわからないね","ts":"1632501939.030300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Vn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"940d9b60-eff8-4fb9-8b2a-034aca40a958","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"マージされるのは `xxxOptions` `xxxParams` くらい","ts":"1632501899.029800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ncQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52a08e0a-c648-4ded-9031-a5b6bafe4e7f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"append じゃないのか…","ts":"1632501871.029400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xloI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7318f0e-bbfd-4c51-b963-9ed921afba1e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"なるほど…","ts":"1632501861.029200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ND8F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6a96328-96e2-465d-8427-ac9153bbc787","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"あー そういう","ts":"1632501854.029000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nVb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cbf1799-8427-4498-9f81-aba9b91bb657","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u0026gt; call ddc#custom#patch_global('sources', ['around'])\nこれ追記じゃなくて完全上書きなので最後のしか適用されない","ts":"1632501831.028800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LCnK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04e94fdb-aa38-43e8-a094-2b93cbf4ba88","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"echo ddc#custom#get_global() すると、こんな感じ\n```{\n  'sourceOptions': {\n    '_': {'ignoreCase': v:true, 'matchers': ['matcher_head'], 'sorters': ['sorter_rank']},\n    'around': {'mark': 'A', 'matchers': ['matcher_full_fuzzy'], 'maxCandidates': 5, 'minAutoCompleteLength': 4},\n    'neosnippet': {'dup': v:true, 'mark': 'ns'},\n    'vim-lsp': {'mark': 'lsp', 'matchers': ['matcher_head'], 'minAutoCompleteLength': 0}\n  },\n  'sourceParams': {'around': {'maxSize': 500}},\n  'sources': ['neosnippet']\n}```","ts":"1632501809.028300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MeX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08adb1ab-1e8e-4afb-b1c2-095d299220b9","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://gist.github.com/raa0121/dca2dc39edd6d89fb6df5cf872e8ff6e\u003e","ts":"1632501581.027600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=qxK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b809920e-3285-4d51-9485-6811df0d2ea4","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"なんか、ddc を使いこなせてない気がする…","ts":"1632501531.027400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aWm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e33d1b9-6b23-4339-befe-a5681426091e","type":"message","user":"UD73ZNZAP","text":"うわぁ、肝心のファイルたちをaddし忘れてました…申し訳ない。雑にpush -fしてしまいました…","ts":"1632570716.084600","thread_ts":"1632561284.076000","parent_user_id":"UBQ2H65JQ","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2H=n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f8c99b2-49a8-42f7-8e96-ba279c7ca0aa","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"オッ","ts":"1632538295.042900","thread_ts":"1632533652.039800","parent_user_id":"U03C4RC8X","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dVH"}]}]
